          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        "description": "Every settings field and every profile value (settings_fields.pack fields and profile_values), its value resolved through the one scope chain (scope_resolver, opened once per render). The evidence of the value follows the level that supplied it: a preset is declared; your setting or a conversation's value is what you said (observed) — except a person value equal to the preset, which config.json may hold only because the auto-upgrade wrote the presets there: it says same_as_preset and stays declared. A secret shows only whether it is set.",
